lf\\\\\\\\s*\\\\\\\\).*?){2}\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-4\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The unittest discovery suite completes successfully.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-5\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Both public functions visibly delegate to the shared private helper while retaining type hints and keeping input handling non-mutating.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"llm_judge\\\",\\\"rubric\\\":\\\"Read solution.py. Confirm rotate and rotate_legacy retain type hints and public definitions, each delegates its shared rotation algorithm to the same private helper, and their implementation does not mutate input collections. Assess only source visible in the file.\\\"}}],\\\"verification\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py test_solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}],\\\"stop_conditions\\\":[],\\\"assumptions\\\":[\\\"Paths are relative to the supplied task workspace; solution.py and test_solution.py may not exist yet and may be created.\\\",\\\"The private helper is expected to have a name beginning with an underscore; its exact name is unspecified.\\\",\\\"Existing signatures, return types, and error behavior are not provided in the request, so their prior definitions must be treated as the compatibility reference when editing.\\\",\\\"The requested unittest discovery command is assumed to discover test_solution.py from the workspace root.\\\"]}\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":17413,\"cached_input_tokens\":14976,\"cache_write_input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":614,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":0}}\n"}
